{"id":"661206","name":"红烧狮子头","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661206/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"马蹄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"马蹄去皮洗净备用。","img":"images/661206/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将马蹄剁碎。","img":"images/661206/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"五花肉绞碎或者剁碎备用。","img":"images/661206/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，盐，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/661206/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入马蹄碎。","img":"images/661206/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入玉米淀粉和鸡蛋。","img":"images/661206/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"摔打搅拌均匀至粘稠状。","img":"images/661206/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量花生油拌匀锁住水份。","img":"images/661206/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"揪一肉馅搓成圆球。","img":"images/661206/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中热油放入狮子头。","img":"images/661206/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火将狮子头炸至金黄定型我盛出。","img":"images/661206/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大葱洗净切细。","img":"images/661206/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅中热油放入大葱炒出香味。","img":"images/661206/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/661206/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入适量老抽，生抽。","img":"images/661206/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入炸好的狮子头。","img":"images/661206/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"大火煮开转中小火焖20分钟左右。","img":"images/661206/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"狮子头焖入味后适量淀粉水勾芡即可。","img":"images/661206/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661206/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661206/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661206/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}